\item NGC3125-A1 (15 Mpc, 0.4 \zsun)
\item MrK71-A (3.5 Mpc, 0.2 \zsun)
\item II Zw 40 – N (11 Mpc, 0.2 \zsun)
\end{itemize}

Galaxies:
