Combining Proposition \ref{prop:sumas_elementos_filas_columnas} and Theorem \ref{thm:group_action}, we get:
\begin{prop} Let $X$ be a finite $T_0$-space that admits a $G$-free action. Then $\sum_{i=1}^{|X|}U_{x_i}$ and $\sum_{i=1}^{|X|}F_{x_i}$ are multiples of $|G|$.
