Then we get a contribution $\frac{\pi^2}{3}E_2S$.

\noindent\textbf{Case 2.} The new vertex is added to the edge that connects the vertices $u$ and $v$. Here $u$, $v$ could be $w_i$ or $z_j$.
\begin{figure}[H]
