  \hline
    Instability & CFI & TSI & OTSI  \\
  \hline
    Growth rate & $\left( \frac{1}{\gamma_b} \frac{n_b}{n_p} \frac{k_\perp^2}{k_p^2 + k_\perp^2} \right)^{1/2} \omega_p$ 
    & $\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2^{4/3}} \frac{1}{\gamma_b} \left( \frac{n_b}{n_p} \right)^{1/3} \omega_p$ 
    & $\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2^{4/3}} \left( \frac{1}{\gamma_b} \frac{n_b}{n_p} \frac{k_\perp^2}{k_p^2 + k_\perp^2}\right)^{1/3} \omega_p$ \\
