The expression of nutrient concentration flux integrated over one intervillous space is the following:
\begin{equation}
    J=-D\int \int_S\vec n \nabla C(r,z)d\vec S
\end{equation}
In dimensionless units this equation becomes:
\begin{equation}
    \tilde J=-2\pi(\int_0^1\frac{\partial c}{\partial \tilde r}\Bigr|_{\substack{\tilde r=1}}d\tilde z - \xi^2 \int_0^1 \tilde r\frac{\partial c}{\partial \tilde z}\Bigr|_{\substack{\tilde z=0}}d\tilde r)
