The backward policy in \our{} is constructed using the \textbf{Recursive Cost Guidance} framework introduced in \Cref{sec:recursive_guidance}. It is composed of two sub-policies: the \textbf{Synthesis Cost Guidance} policy $P^S_B$ (\Cref{sec:synthesis_cost_guidance}) and the \textbf{Decomposability Guidance} policy $P^D_B$ (\Cref{sec:decomposability_guidance}).


